<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Factura #<%= factura.numero %> - SIGIF</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #15803d;
      --primary-dark: #166534;
      --text: #1e293b;
      --muted: #64748b;
      --border: #e2e8f0;
      --bg-soft: #f8fafc;
    }
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
    }
    body {
      background-color: #f1f5f9;
      color: var(--text);
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }
    .print-actions {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px auto;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .btn-action {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    .btn-print {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
    }
    .btn-print:hover {
      background: var(--primary-dark);
    }
    .btn-back {
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--text);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .btn-back:hover {
      background: #f8fafc;
    }
    .invoice-container {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
      padding: 45px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .invoice-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
      padding-bottom: 25px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .company-info h2 {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0f172a;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .company-info p {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 4px;
    }
    .invoice-badge-box {
      text-align: right;
    }
    .invoice-num {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary);
      background: #dcfce7;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }
    .invoice-date {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .invoice-meta-cols {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }
    .meta-box {
      background: var(--bg-soft);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .meta-box h4 {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .meta-box p {
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .meta-box p strong {
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .meta-box p span {
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .table-container {
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      text-align: left;
    }
    th {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      font-size: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 700;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
    }
    td {
      padding: 14px 16px;
      font-size: 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .col-qty {
      text-align: center;
      width: 80px;
    }
    .col-price, .col-total {
      text-align: right;
      width: 140px;
    }
    .totals-area {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    .totals-card {
      width: 300px;
      background: var(--bg-soft);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 18px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .totals-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .totals-row.grand-total {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary);
      border-top: 2px solid var(--border);
      padding-top: 10px;
      margin-top: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .invoice-footer-note {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 40px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px dashed var(--border);
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    @media print {
      body {
        background: #fff;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .print-actions {
        display: none !important;
      }
      .invoice-container {
        box-shadow: none;
        border: none;
        padding: 0;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="print-actions">
    <a href="/facturacion" class="btn-action btn-back">
      <i class="bi bi-arrow-left"></i> Volver a Facturación
    </a>
    <button onclick="window.print()" class="btn-action btn-print">
      <i class="bi bi-printer"></i> Imprimir / Guardar en PDF
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="invoice-container">
    <div class="invoice-header">
      <div class="company-info">
        <h2><i class="bi bi-receipt text-success"></i> SIGIF</h2>
        <p>Sistema Integral de Gestión e Inventario</p>
        <p>NIT: 900.824.123-1 | Tel: +57 (601) 321 0000</p>
        <p>Régimen Común - Factura Electrónica de Venta</p>
      </div>
      <div class="invoice-badge-box">
        <div class="invoice-num">Factura #<%= factura.numero %></div>
        <div class="invoice-date">
          <i class="bi bi-calendar-event"></i>
          <%= new Date(factura.fecha).toLocaleDateString('es-ES', { day: '2-digit', month: '2-digit', year: 'numeric' }) %>
          <%= new Date(factura.fecha).toLocaleTimeString('es-ES', { hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit' }) %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="invoice-meta-cols">
      <div class="meta-box">
        <h4>Datos del Cliente</h4>
        <p><span>Cliente:</span> <strong><%= (factura.cliente && factura.cliente.nombre) ? factura.cliente.nombre : 'Consumidor Final' %></strong></p>
        <p><span>Correo:</span> <strong><%= (factura.cliente && factura.cliente.correo) ? factura.cliente.correo : 'consumidorfinal@pos.com' %></strong></p>
        <% if (factura.cliente && factura.cliente.telefono) { %>
          <p><span>Teléfono:</span> <strong><%= factura.cliente.telefono %></strong></p>
        <% } %>
      </div>

      <div class="meta-box">
        <h4>Detalles de la Venta</h4>
        <p><span>Vendedor:</span> <strong><%= factura.vendedor || 'medevs' %></strong></p>
        <p><span>Método de Pago:</span> <strong><%= factura.metodoPago || 'Efectivo' %></strong></p>
        <p><span>Estado:</span> <strong style="color: #16a34a; text-transform: uppercase;"><%= factura.estado || 'Pagada' %></strong></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="table-container">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Descripción del Producto</th>
            <th class="col-qty">Cant.</th>
            <th class="col-price">Precio Unit.</th>
            <th class="col-total">Subtotal</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <% if (factura.productos && factura.productos.length > 0) { %>
            <% factura.productos.forEach(function(prod) { %>
              <tr>
                <td><strong><%= prod.nombre %></strong></td>
                <td class="col-qty"><%= prod.cantidad %></td>
                <td class="col-price">$<%= Number(prod.precio).toLocaleString('en-US') %></td>
                <td class="col-total">$<%= Number(prod.subtotal || (prod.cantidad * prod.precio)).toLocaleString('en-US') %></td>
              </tr>
            <% }); %>
          <% } else { %>
            <tr>
              <td>Venta General</td>
              <td class="col-qty">1</td>
              <td class="col-price">$<%= Number(factura.total).toLocaleString('en-US') %></td>
              <td class="col-total">$<%= Number(factura.total).toLocaleString('en-US') %></td>
            </tr>
          <% } %>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="totals-area">
      <div class="totals-card">
        <div class="totals-row">
          <span>Base Gravable:</span>
          <strong>$<%= Number(factura.baseGravable || 0).toLocaleString('en-US') %></strong>
        </div>
        <div class="totals-row">
          <span>IVA (<%= factura.ivaPorcentaje || 19 %>%):</span>
          <strong>$<%= Number(factura.iva || 0).toLocaleString('en-US') %></strong>
        </div>
        <div class="totals-row grand-total">
          <span>Total:</span>
          <span>$<%= Number(factura.total).toLocaleString('en-US') %></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="invoice-footer-note">
      <p>Esta factura constituye título valor de acuerdo con la normatividad legal vigente.</p>
      <p>¡Gracias por su compra en SIGIF!</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
